        <briefdescription>
<para>Open the PTY pair and spawn the shell process. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Calls <computeroutput>openpty()</computeroutput> to create the master/slave pair with the requested initial window size, forks the child, runs <computeroutput><ref refid="_unix_t_t_y_8cpp_1a8639e31b69eec8ce9fad80b4eb378e19" kindref="member">runChildProcess()</ref></computeroutput> in the child, closes the slave fd in the parent, sets the master to <computeroutput>O_NONBLOCK</computeroutput>, and starts the reader thread.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dims</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Initial terminal dimensions (cols x rows in cells). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>shell</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Shell program name or absolute path. Resolved via <computeroutput>$PATH</computeroutput> using <computeroutput>execvp()</computeroutput> when not absolute. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>args</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Space-separated arguments for the shell (e.g. &quot;-l&quot;). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>workingDirectory</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classOptional" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Optional</ref> initial working directory for the shell. If empty, the shell inherits the parent&apos;s cwd. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput>true</computeroutput> on success; <computeroutput>false</computeroutput> if <computeroutput>openpty()</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>fork()</computeroutput> fails.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD context. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
