<simplesect kind="note"><para>May be called from any thread.</para>
</simplesect>
Uses a non-blocking <computeroutput>waitpid (WNOHANG)</computeroutput>. Returns 0 if the child is still running, which is mapped to <computeroutput>true</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput>true</computeroutput> if the child process has not yet exited.</para>
</simplesect>
