    <briefdescription>
<para>macOS / Linux PTY backend using openpty() and fork(). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages the master file descriptor and child process PID. All blocking I/O on the master fd is performed on the reader thread inherited from <ref refid="class_t_t_y" kindref="compound">TTY</ref>. The master fd is set to <computeroutput>O_NONBLOCK</computeroutput> after fork so that <computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1a0f2c38d817e1c94759b38a832fa1ed0e" kindref="member">read()</ref></computeroutput> returns immediately when no data is available.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Thread model</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1ad0e7e406b8f747bd2b48d8d08ea89954" kindref="member">open()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1a3fb4f048230f94368b8a7e857c7d5e64" kindref="member">close()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1a51c5fb1d27ef4ee6db9389c90c568a7e" kindref="member">write()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1a75132fbf0ba430260be493446acfcb3d" kindref="member">setWinsize()</ref></computeroutput> — message thread</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1a0f2c38d817e1c94759b38a832fa1ed0e" kindref="member">read()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_unix_t_t_y_1a3a6b9ad6735b28d5a4004a3497c9299d" kindref="member">waitForData()</ref></computeroutput> — reader thread (called from <ref refid="class_t_t_y_1a5069e6a70b48c9e44fef6d6fd8fa2b31" kindref="member">TTY::run</ref>)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="class_t_t_y" kindref="compound">TTY</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
